{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p033a","title":"曹操拒听袁绍游说","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p033a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"袁绍使人以其势盛、子长游说曹操，曹操不应，并渐生诛灭袁绍之意。","evidence":["wudi-e-p033a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"遣人游说","evidence":["wudi-e-p033a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"不应","evidence":["wudi-e-p033a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"初平元年","year":190,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p033a-q","wudi-q-o009","wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde"],"chronology":"wudi-y190","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o009","basis":"初平元年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,139,"P033a"],"order":68}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p033a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-dbfaf1b2e5498713bebd","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《魏书》曰：“太祖大笑曰：‘吾不听汝也！’绍复使人说太祖曰：‘今袁公势盛兵强，二子已长；天下群英，孰逾于此？’太祖不应。由是益不直绍，图诛灭之。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ad81a1d59df6c578bc28","start":0,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞